# Time directories are solver OUTPUT and are regenerated by blockMesh plus
# buoyantBoussinesqSimpleFoam from the dictionaries beside them, which ARE
# tracked in the rung this tree grades.
#
# The rule lives HERE rather than in the repository `.gitignore` for the reason
# the D403 re-run tree gives at its own `.gitignore`: that file is shared, it
# carried several other lanes' uncommitted work while this ran, and a write-back
# to a shared file is a merge. A directory-local ignore needs no merge and
# travels with the tree it describes.
#
# `[0-9]*` matches `0.orig` as well, which is why the negations are not
# optional: `0.orig` holds the initial conditions and is the one input a solver
# cannot regenerate. That glob deleted every initial condition in the sibling
# tree once already.
*/[0-9]*/
!*/0.orig/
!*/0.orig/**
*/constant/polyMesh/
